  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1270094,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Prepare for double the fun with this incredible two-game collection for your Game Boy Advance! First, dive into the adrenaline-pumping world of *Sonic Battle*, a unique and fast-paced fighting game unlike anything you’ve experienced. Choose from nine iconic characters and unleash a flurry of attacks in a dynamic, 3D isometric arena. Master Aerial, Ground, and Guard-based attacks to unlock a staggering nine special moves, customizable between rounds! Battle through Story Mode, challenge your skills, hone your techniques in Training, or compete in hilarious Mini Games. Even better, link up to four Game Boy Advances for chaotic, four-player battles!\n\nThen, switch gears to the frantic puzzle action of *ChuChu Rocket*! Indirectly control adorable mice, guiding them to safety by strategically placing arrows while evading a mischievous cat. Perfect for multiplayer mayhem, this mode becomes a hilarious free-for-all where each player’s mice follow only their color’s instructions. Test your puzzle-solving skills against the CPU or tackle pre-designed challenges. Get ready for a whirlwind of speed and strategy!"
    },
